{"title":"Mock AIME 6 2006-2007 Problems/Problem 8","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_6_2006-2007_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A sequence of positive reals defined by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/c/c3c99415f2b05e874db66feb0ca9ddbb83c55587.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_0=x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"51\" height=\"10\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde199bb987dcb0ab2e7bd8225f449be1968a44.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_1=y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"50\" height=\"11\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/7/f27eb2bb2d8662dfa2bc2cf924328ff6f906620e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_n\\cdot a_{n+2}=a_{n+1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"124\" height=\"12\" /> for all integers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/2/3/9238d82d59d5dfe79e96d916bfdf2f4acc4ed3be.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n\\ge 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"43\" height=\"15\" />.  Given that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/d/c/7dc35a34de6ea671b14a8c7784d152b782e26068.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_{2007}+a_{2008}=3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"129\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/3/0/6305134e37251c2312cfaadd2477a30e963f4c12.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_{2007}\\cdot a_{2008}=\\frac 13$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"122\" height=\"37\" />, find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/2/0/220e6c3611bc2278660fbae0530fcf9e414540a2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^3+y^3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"55\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_6_2006-2007_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/c/c3c99415f2b05e874db66feb0ca9ddbb83c55587.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_0=x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"51\" height=\"10\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde199bb987dcb0ab2e7bd8225f449be1968a44.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_1=y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"50\" height=\"11\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/0/8/c0823229dba74ad0ea851be943229481eb0b0e22.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_2=\\frac{a_1}{a_0}=\\frac{y}{x}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -16px\" width=\"103\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/0/d100fc4d6deb738c159a7a6a44d4ab4fa78c467f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_3=\\frac{a_2}{a_1}=\\frac{\\frac{y}{x}}{y}=\\frac{1}{x}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"143\" height=\"44\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/b/6cb9cbf8771222118c666741d896b66f9dc4f5ad.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_4=\\frac{a_3}{a_2}=\\frac{\\frac{1}{x}}{\\frac{y}{x}}=\\frac{1}{y}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -20px\" width=\"142\" height=\"49\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/3/b/03b7c249a3329a7fe21b7f9ff4866c2ac38eb818.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_5=\\frac{a_4}{a_3}=\\frac{\\frac{1}{y}}{\\frac{1}{x}}=\\frac{x}{y}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -20px\" width=\"143\" height=\"51\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/b/9/eb9787a82ee4103b5bf3bf2f412df0a59fc98bed.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_6=\\frac{a_5}{a_4}=\\frac{\\frac{x}{y}}{\\frac{1}{y}}=x=a_0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -22px\" width=\"180\" height=\"51\" /> \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/6/f56fd7cfb888cfd63f2933163a5add3275cef041.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_7=\\frac{a_6}{a_5}=\\frac{x}{\\frac{x}{y}}=y=a_1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -22px\" width=\"179\" height=\"43\" />\n</p><p>And the sequence repeats every 6 steps. \n</p><p>Therefore,\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/7/0/47025db1466b118efd86c673558a74c3249e5f49.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_n=a_{n\\;mod\\;6}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"103\" height=\"13\" />\n</p><p>Since, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/9/0/190e116d6368ba9fe170e5ad83a2a2498207f68c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2007 \\equiv 3\\;(mod\\;6)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"139\" height=\"20\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/1/a/91ac6049d4bf2bcba37f78063e6831f14d4837d9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2008 \\equiv 4\\;(mod\\;6)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"139\" height=\"20\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/5/6/1562e3408bb643a3199aac71362012821b488d40.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_{2007}=a_3=\\frac{1}{x}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"119\" height=\"38\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/b/4/9b441809f1c353cc9440fd232c0d86c45f457d69.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_{2008}=a_4=\\frac{1}{y}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"118\" height=\"42\" />\n</p><p>From <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/3/0/6305134e37251c2312cfaadd2477a30e963f4c12.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_{2007}\\cdot a_{2008}=\\frac 13$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"122\" height=\"37\" />, we get  <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/c/8/5c803463767590a45115fec348e9370921b7c049.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{xy}=\\frac{1}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"63\" height=\"42\" />, thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/7/c67c9a7d90d8ea5587556755778cbd231ca95fd3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$xy=3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"55\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p>and from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/d/c/7dc35a34de6ea671b14a8c7784d152b782e26068.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_{2007}+a_{2008}=3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"129\" height=\"15\" />, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/0/9a0c61cc2587618d08f463570e7595d15ac34215.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{x}+\\frac{1}{y}=3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"85\" height=\"42\" />. \n</p><p>Therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/7/7/777052e6a91c40bccf0a9d62fd1080e22a83fdbb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{x+y}{xy}=3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"81\" height=\"41\" /> which gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/4/7/247df576018a05bc2aea18abfbf6c2000bcd3069.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x+y=3xy=(3)(3)=9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"201\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p>Then, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/c/6/2c6951d021b006d3fa59b65cd27f63eda7c0244f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x+y)^2=81$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"108\" height=\"21\" /> which gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/a/f/1afa74464a2a022ef6db5d29306396df22f151ba.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2+2xy+y^2=81$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"153\" height=\"20\" /> which gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/3/5/7359c58486faea629bceb8b6c2a42d9f48284c54.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2+y^2=81-2xy=81-(2)(3)=75$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"306\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p>Finally, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/6/3f609bdcb4cff846f2647bd0541251b411096f95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^3+y^3=(x+y)(x^2-xy+y^2)=(9)(75-3)=\\boxed{648}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"427\" height=\"25\" />\n</p><p>~Tomas Diaz. orders@tomasdiaz.com\n</p><p><i>Alternate solutions are always welcome. If you have a different, elegant solution to this problem, please <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_6_2006-2007_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit\">add it</a> to this page.</i>\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018040630\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.019 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.032 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 117/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 383/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 6069/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    7.444      1 Template:Alternate_solutions\n100.00%    7.444      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:25879:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018040630 and revision id 205925. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}